α ≥ 0.75 (most conservative)\")","+report_lines.append(\"- **Threshold = 5%**: catches α ≥ 0.10 but triggers false alarm on null — not recommended\\n\")"," "," report_lines.append(\"## Artifacts\\n\")"," report_lines.append(\"- `threshold_sensitivity.csv` — trigger gen × threshold × α\")"," report_lines.append(\"- `intervention_ppl_reduction.csv` — PPL reduction per gen per experiment\")"," report_lines.append(\"- `fig_threshold_timing.pdf` — trigger gen vs threshold\")","-report_lines.append(\"- `fig_threshold_ppl.pdf` — PPL recovery vs threshold\")","+report_lines.append(\"- `fig_threshold_ppl.pdf` — PPL trajectories: intervention vs counterfactual\")"," report_lines.append(\"- `fig_roc_detection.pdf` — detection–false alarm tradeoff\")"," "," with open(OUT / 'report.md', 'w') as f:"]}],"originalFile":"import json\nimport csv\nimport numpy as np\nimport matplotlib\nmatplotlib.use('Agg')\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nOUT = Path(__file__).parent\n\n# ── Data (extracted from server) ──────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n# Alpha sweep (no intervention) — token_entropy per generation\nalpha_sweep = {\n    0.00: [3.2342, 2.9906, 3.0210, 3.0143, 3.0407, 3.0335, 3.0566, 3.0500, 3.0663, 3.0427, 3.0693],\n    0.10: [3.2342, 2.9861, 3.0126, 3.0295, 3.0241, 3.0352, 3.0489, 3.0548, 3.0515, 3.0684, 3.0858],\n    0.25: [3.2342, 2.9830, 3.0154, 3.0395, 3.0511, 3.0340, 3.0488, 3.0668, 3.0631, 3.1037, 3.0794],\n    0.50: [3.2342, 2.5131, 2.5110, 2.5816, 2.5883, 2.5856, 2.6080, 2.6564, 2.6603, 2.6724, 2.7075],\n    0.75: [3.2342, 2.1738, 2.1055, 2.0913, 2.1229, 2.1407, 2.1617, 2.1652, 2.2023, 2.2407, 2.2830],\n    1.00: [3.2342, 1.9099, 1.4611, 1.3379, 1.2805, 1.2912, 1.2253, 1.2369, 1.2482, 1.2390, 1.2269],\n}\n\n# Alpha sweep — perplexity per generation\nalpha_ppl = {\n    0.00: [26.949, 19.299, 20.014, 20.262, 20.524, 20.922, 20.991, 20.955, 20.863, 21.015, 21.108],\n    0.10: [26.949, 19.127, 20.035, 20.363, 20.549, 20.967, 20.818, 21.